  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47a96cd1d329644076e0d5d80191ff8bf4d2fe8f_0.webp\" alt=\"quickswap_logo_big\"><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f7f9bfc707238d5f771b48e42c10b193ae105317.png\"><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>這是為《Epic Fight》模組新增裝備載入系統的擴充套件</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這讓您可以裝備更多武器，並透過單鍵即可快速切換裝備。</p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8ad1d230b8024e6136522ac323c1350c6ee3052.png\" width=\"359\" height=\"131\"><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請問能支援 1.21.1 嗎？</strong> 也許有一天會吧。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請問能移植至舊版本嗎？</strong> 答案同上。</p>\n<p><strong><br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d9f50b27c02bef8209a8297e727ab44261ed4c08_0.webp\" width=\"542\" height=\"126\"><br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br><br><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">錯誤回報請於此處留言：</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f955784714264932362%252f1482725725290369025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/955784714264932362/1482725725290369025</a><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>或於此處：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1481294346933375100%252f1481325691718078484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/1481294346933375100/1481325691718078484</a></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b412707b37e196f163b9b93962b0924b8af64820.png\"><br></span></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>歡迎查看我的朋友所製作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Rapier Addon</a>，以獲取更多模型與內容！<br>也歡迎查看由傑出團隊打造的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/ascendra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ascendra Modpack</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/horyzen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horyzen Modpack</a>。</strong><br><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2bc05122fec4f505ec4c72474e54599c2f6bc3d.png\"><br></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 Epic Fight 團隊開發了如此精彩的模組與 API。</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>感謝 Yonchi Chikito 提供的支援。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 Epic Fight 社群，讓這個模組成為現實。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
